the province in a consistent framework. So as described by OBCM, cities and municipalities play

02:37:54.610 --> 02:37:59.210
a vital role in meeting housing demand and

02:37:59.710 --> 02:38:04.170
building sustainable communities. Cities are working with regional governments and

02:38:04.670 --> 02:38:09.570
housing service managers to expand infrastructure

02:38:10.070 --> 02:38:13.230
and support affordable housing through five key strategies: unlocking land for housing, enabling greater

02:38:13.730 --> 02:38:17.330
density, reducing barriers for developers and property owners, streamlining reviews

02:38:17.650 --> 02:38:22.250
and approvals, and supporting affordable and

02:38:22.750 --> 02:38:26.650
non-market housing. We're proud to be here

02:38:27.150 --> 02:38:31.050
before you today with this

02:38:31.550 --> 02:38:35.600
revised presentation and to share Guelph's significant progress within each of these five areas.

02:38:36.100 --> 02:38:39.520
So with that, I'll hand it over to DCAO Gaiman. Thank you,

02:38:40.020 --> 02:38:43.200
