02:39:07.610 --> 02:39:11.630
for critical infrastructure, short and long-term strategies and action

02:39:12.130 --> 02:39:15.390
plans, successful grant applications, process improvements and innovations, and we have advanced key developments that

02:39:15.890 --> 02:39:19.630
support more housing in the community. More than 120 housing-related staff reports have been before

02:39:20.130 --> 02:39:23.950
you for deliberation over

02:39:24.450 --> 02:39:28.100
this term of council. In 2025 alone, there were 34 housing

02:39:28.600 --> 02:39:38.940
related reports. We're proud of the work the city is leading, supporting and

02:39:39.440 --> 02:39:43.420
influencing to help address the housing crisis, sustain growth, strengthen investment readiness

02:39:43.920 --> 02:39:47.500
and enhance Guelph's overall livability. In our time together today,

02:39:48.000 --> 02:39:51.900
